{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChB3raDxy57umBkMayDQd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Wf3vqXohtKZiYowpXGxa7D","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/nick/code/roast.ts-rewrite-09-differential-harness-and-m1-scenarios; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='AGENTS.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nadd='''- Differential harness (`test/diff/`, temporary, deleted at M6):\n  `npm run test:diff` bundles the CLI and `test/diff/index.ts`, runs the\n  harness self-tests (no Go needed), then every scenario against the Go\n  baseline built at `cd08f10` into\n  `node_modules/.cache/roast-diff/` (delete it to force a rebuild).\n  Without `go` on `PATH` every scenario is a TAP skip. Add a milestone's\n  scenarios as a `Scenario[]` under `test/diff/scenarios/` and list it in\n  `SCENARIOS` (`index.ts`); `server`, `records`, and `requests` turn on\n  the fake server and record/request comparison. A difference caused by\n  a deliberate change goes in `ALLOWLIST` (`allowlist.ts`) naming the\n  change number; Go behavior judged wrong goes in the owning area's Open\n  questions, never patched in the harness.\n'''\nmarker='''- Live tests live under `test/live/`'''\nassert marker in s\ns=s.replace(marker, add+marker,1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat >> .redeye/notes.md <<'EOF'\n- Comparison layer: normalize.ts, compare.ts (deepDiff, kv parse),\n  records.ts (+tar.ts reader with PAX/GNU long names, zstd via node:zlib),\n  requests.ts (grouped by model#turns, transport headers ignored, values\n  only for content-type and auth scheme), allowlist.ts. Self-tested in\n  selftest/compare.ts.\n- scenario.ts runScenario: one tmp root, go then ts, each with its own\n  fixture repo + home, shared fake server (requests sliced per side);\n  compares trust.exit, exit, stdout (kv/json), records, requests.\n- selftest/harness.ts: TS-vs-TS equal; stub exiting 3 -> unexplained\n  ['exit']; stub with other severity -> ['stdout.severity']; volatile\n  node stub (fresh run id/ts/version/session/UA, records, request) run\n  twice compares equal.\n- M1 scenarios (scenarios/m1.ts): 8 valid + 17 invalid config cases, each\n  through `gate settings` (kv stdout) and `trust --yes` (exit only) = 50.\n  All pass. Only allowlisted difference: change 7 (\"Gate\" key accepted\n  case-insensitively by Go, exit 0; TS exits 2).\n- Decision: a missing `go` skips every scenario even when a cached binary\n  exists (acceptance says \"go absent -> every scenario is a TAP skip\";\n  spec 2.13 step order is ambiguous).\n- Verified manually: second `npm run test:diff` with a logging `go` shim\n  on PATH never invoked go; PATH without go -> 50 SKIPs, exit 0;\n  mutations removing RUN_ID / path / session normalization fail\n  self-tests.\n- CI: job `differential` in ci.yml (ubuntu-26.04, Node 22, Go from\n  go.mod, fetch-depth 0 so cd08f10 is present), runs bundle + test:diff.\n  actionlint passes.\n- Go baseline build takes ~10s locally; binary ~92 MB.\nEOF\ngit add AGENTS.md && git commit -qm \"AGENTS.md: differential harness notes\" && echo ok"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":460,"cache_read_input_tokens":162117,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":460},"output_tokens":228,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c00c7f3-71f4-4751-b678-7052dcc92742","uuid":"2ad957f4-b895-4511-a121-c42ecb349c7b","timestamp":"2026-11-18T20:47:55.761Z","request_id":"req_011ChB3ra1oiLSE8v9riqprf","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Wf3vqXohtKZiYowpXGxa7D":{"command":"cd /Users/nick/code/roast.ts-rewrite-09-differential-harness-and-m1-scenarios; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='AGENTS.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nadd='''- Differential harness (`test/diff/`, tempor